        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>6 Foot Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClean contemporary 72\" ladder style door pull handle made of stainless steel.  For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. Warm <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish or Bright <b>Polished Stainless Steel</b> requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-DJO162_size.gif?v=1704354657\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"6 Foot Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-foot-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>48\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/5-foot-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>60\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/7-foot-long-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>84\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 72\" contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4\" round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-DJO162 6 Foot Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\" (6 feet)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 60\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Satin or Polished Stainless Steel </li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "6 Foot Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "These 72 inch contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4 inch round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  Clean, Contemporary, Solid. For use on residential and commercial doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish or Bright Polished Stainless Steel finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
                "keywords": "DWD-DJO162 72 Inch Contemporary Stainless Door Pulls, 72 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pulls, Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pulls, Don-Jo 162 72 inch commercial door pulls, storefront door pulls, storefront stainless door pulls, stainless storefront door pulls, 6 Foot Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pulls, 6 Foot door handles, 6 feet long door handles, 6 feet door handles,"
